<p>Enter a concealed sniping stance, increasing your weapon's attack range and vision range by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3,</acronym> giving all incoming damage a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">18%, 30%, 36%, 42%, 48%</acronym> chance to miss you, and causing your Headshot, Volley and Called Shots to behave as if the target was marked.</p><p>Any non-instant, non-movement action will break concealment, but the increased range and vision and damage avoidance will persist for 3 turns, with the damage avoidance decreasing in power by 33% each turn.</p><p>This requires a bow to use, and cannot be used if there are foes in sight within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9, 7, 6, 6, 5.</acronym></p>